cngpt NEWS — user-visible changes by release

Version 0.1.0 (2026-03-16)
  * Initial release.
  * Full GPT-2 forward pass (12-layer / 768-embd / 12-head) in C with
    OpenBLAS BLAS-3 matmuls.
  * Manual backpropagation and AdamW optimizer with cosine LR schedule
    and linear warmup.
  * Autoregressive sampling with temperature and top-k filtering.
  * mmap-based binary data loader (uint16 token ids).
  * scripts/export_weights.py — HuggingFace GPT-2 → cngpt binary format.
  * Compiler-flag benchmark harness (tests/bench.sh) sweeping BASE through
    PGO + FULL, plus OpenBLAS thread count sweep.
  * GNU autotools packaging (./configure && make && make install).
  * Troff manpage (man/cngpt.1).
